# BeanNote

Keep `db.py`, `ocr.py`, `translations.py`, and `main.py` as the Python modules. UI lives in `static/index.html`. Docker copies the full app via `COPY . .` — do not revert to a file allowlist, and keep first-party packages out of `.dockerignore`.

- Mobile header support pill copy comes from i18n key `support_header` (DA: "☕ Støt"). No hardcoded button labels.

- Local DB: `./data/beannote.db` (auto-flush on startup). Production DB: `/app/data/beannote.db` (never auto-flush).
- Deduplicate with `UNIQUE(name, roaster)` and `difflib.get_close_matches` at 80% before every insert.
- After user-facing changes: bump `VERSION` in `db.py`, append `CHANGELOG.md`, commit `snapshot: vX.Y.Z - <feature>`.
- Palette is Espresso `#3c2a21`, Terracotta `#b85c38`, Cream `#faf6f0`.
